<< /Length 720 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
13 TL
(10. Priority Sector Lending Certificates \(PSLCs\): Banks may purchase or sell PSLCs to manage PSL target shortfalls or surpluses) Tj
T*
(across four categories: PSLC Agriculture, PSLC Small and Marginal Farmer, PSLC Micro Enterprises, and PSLC General.) Tj
T*
(11. Trading on e-Kuber: PSLC transactions are settled electronically through the Reserve Bank's e-Kuber portal without transfer of credit) Tj
T*
(risk or loan assets.) Tj
T*
(12. Monitoring Frequency: PSL compliance is monitored on a quarterly basis based on the average of achievements across four quarters of) Tj
T*
(the financial year.) Tj
T*
(Yours faithfully,) Tj
T*
(\(G. S. Rawat\)) Tj
T*
(Chief General Manager) Tj
T*
ET
